---
kind: ObjectType
version: v1
definition:
  name: EligibilityChecks_1
  description: Real-time eligibility verification checks performed before services or claims. Stores HIPAA 270/271 transaction results for coverage verification, benefit limits, and prior authorization requirements.
  fields:
    - name: checkedAt
      type: Timestamptz!
      description: Timestamp when the eligibility verification was performed against the payer system. Critical for timely filing and coverage validation at time of service.
    - name: createdAt
      type: Timestamptz!
      description: Timestamp when this eligibility check record was created in the system.
    - name: id
      type: Uuid!
      description: Unique identifier for this eligibility check. Primary key for audit trails and verification history.
    - name: memberId
      type: Uuid!
      description: Foreign key to the member whose coverage was verified. Links eligibility results to patient record.
    - name: result
      type: Json!
      description: Structured JSON response from eligibility verification. Contains active coverage status, benefit details, copay/coinsurance amounts, deductible balances, and prior authorization requirements.
  graphql:
    typeName: EligibilityChecks1
    inputTypeName: EligibilityChecks1Input
